# Project rules: Data dashboard

- Never make up or fake data. If data is missing, show an empty state and tell me.
- Treat source data as read-only. The dashboard never writes back to the source.
- Load and clean data in one function, cached with @st.cache_data.
- Show where the data came from and when it was last updated on the page.
- Label every chart axis with units and keep number formatting consistent.
- Ask before adding a database, login, or a different charting library.
